# Scratch pages the capture tools write and re-write on every run.
#
# `crop-ref`, `zoom`, `sample-shot` and `inline-shots` each need a real HTML
# file on disk rather than `page.setContent`: setContent leaves the document on
# the about:blank origin, which cannot load `file:` subresources, so the image
# silently never arrives and every crop comes back a flat rectangle. These are
# that file. The TOOLS are source and are tracked; their scratch is not.
.*.html
